{
 "schemaVersion": 1,
 "testId": "mock-test-5",
 "items": {
  "1": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Yo‘l tezlik grafigi ostidagi yuzaga teng (trapetsiya):"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "s=\\frac{4\\cdot10}{2}+6\\cdot10+\\frac{4\\cdot10}{2}=20+60+20=100\\ \\text{m}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 100 m"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "2": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Harakatni teskari tomondan qaraymiz: oxirgi nuqtadan boshlab jism tinch holatdan tekis tezlanuvchan harakat qiladi. Ketma-ket sekundlarda bosilgan yo‘llar $1:3:5:7:9$ nisbatda."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{a\\cdot1^2}{2}=5\\;\\Rightarrow\\;a=10\\ \\text{m/s}^2"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Teskari tartibda: 5-sekund ↔ 1 qism (5 m), 4-sekund ↔ 3 qism, 3-sekund ↔ 5 qism, **2-sekund ↔ 7 qism**, 1-sekund ↔ 9 qism."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "s_2=7\\cdot5=35\\ \\text{m}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 35 m"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "3": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "H=\\frac{v_0^2\\sin^2\\alpha}{2g},\\quad L=\\frac{v_0^2\\sin2\\alpha}{g}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\frac LH=\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{tg}\\alpha}=4\\ (\\alpha=45^\\circ)"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "L=4H=60\\ \\text{m}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 60 m"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "4": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "F=ma=25\\cdot2=50\\ \\text{N},\\qquad F_2=\\sqrt{F^2-F_1^2}=\\sqrt{2500-900}=40\\ \\text{N}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 40 N"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "5": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "p_1=4\\cdot2=8,\\quad p_2=3\\cdot1=3\\ \\text{kg·m/s}"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "p=\\sqrt{p_1^2+p_2^2+2p_1p_2\\cos120^\\circ}=\\sqrt{64+9-24}=7\\ \\text{kg·m/s}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 7 kg·m/s"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "6": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "P_s=P-\\rho_sgV=P\\left(1-\\frac{\\rho_s}{\\rho}\\right)=\\frac P7\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\frac{\\rho_s}{\\rho}=\\frac67"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\rho=\\frac{7\\cdot600}{6}=700\\ \\text{kg/m}^3,\\qquad \\rho-\\rho_s=100\\ \\text{kg/m}^3"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 100 kg/m³"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "7": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$h=0{,}4$ m, $m=80$ kg; muz to‘liq botgan holda odamni tutib turadi"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\rho_sShg=\\rho_mShg+mg\\;\\Rightarrow\\;S=\\frac{m}{(\\rho_s-\\rho_m)h}=\\frac{80}{100\\cdot0{,}4}=2\\ \\text{m}^2"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 2 m²"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "8": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$m=28$ kg, taxta vaznsiz, o‘ng uchi devorga sharnir bilan mahkamlangan"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Bola ipni $F$ kuch bilan pastga tortadi, ip esa bolani $F$ kuch bilan yuqoriga tortadi. Shuning uchun bolaning taxtaga bosim kuchi $N=mg-F$. Ipning ikkinchi uchi taxtani $F$ kuch bilan yuqoriga tortadi."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Devordagi sharnirga nisbatan momentlar. Rasmga ko‘ra bola devordan $4l$, ipning taxtaga mahkamlangan joyi $3l$ uzoqlikda:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "(mg-F)\\cdot4l=F\\cdot3l\\;\\Rightarrow\\;F=\\frac47mg=\\frac47\\cdot280=160\\ \\text{N}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** 160 N"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "9": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Bir xil vaqtda tebranishlar soni chastotaga proporsional: $\\nu_1=2\\nu_2$, demak $T_2=2T_1$."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "T=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac lg}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\frac{l_2}{l_1}=\\left(\\frac{T_2}{T_1}\\right)^2=4"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 4"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "10": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "v=\\sqrt{\\frac{3RT}{\\mu}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{3\\cdot8{,}31\\cdot10^3\\cdot10^7}{1}}\\approx5\\cdot10^5\\ \\text{m/s}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** $5\\cdot10^5$ m/s"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "11": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$V$ va $T$ o‘zgarmas, $pV=\\frac mMRT$, demak $p\\propto m$. Gazning $\\frac15$ qismi qoladi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "p_2=\\frac{500}{5}=100\\ \\text{kPa}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 100 kPa"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "12": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "1→2 — izobarik kengayish (gaz ish bajaradi, $A=2$ kJ), 2→3 — izoxorik sovish (issiqlik sovitkichga beriladi). 1 va 3 nuqtalar bitta izotermada yotadi: $T_3=T_1$."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\Delta U_{12}=\\frac32\\nu R\\Delta T_{12}=\\frac32A=3\\ \\text{kJ}"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "2→3 da ish yo‘q, $Q_{23}=\\Delta U_{23}=-\\Delta U_{12}$ (chunki $T_3=T_1$). Demak sovitkichga $3$ kJ issiqlik beriladi."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{\\Delta U_{12}}{|Q_{23}|}=1"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** Farq qilmaydi"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "13": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$d=1$ mm, $\\sigma=0{,}47$ N/m, $\\rho=13\\,600$ kg/m³, ho‘llamaydi"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Ho‘llamaydigan suyuqlik kapillyarda **pasayadi**:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "h=\\frac{4\\sigma}{\\rho gd}=\\frac{4\\cdot0{,}47}{13\\,600\\cdot10\\cdot10^{-3}}\\approx0{,}014\\ \\text{m}=14\\ \\text{mm}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 14 mm past"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "14": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\eta=1-\\frac{Q_2}{Q_1}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;Q_1=\\frac{700}{0{,}5}=1400\\ \\text{J},\\qquad A=Q_1-Q_2=700\\ \\text{J}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 700 J"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "15": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "d=\\frac UE=\\frac{300}{30\\,000}=0{,}01\\ \\text{m}=10\\ \\text{mm}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 10 mm"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "16": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Ketma-ket ulanishda har bir kondensator zaryadi bir xil va umumiy zaryadga teng:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac1C=\\frac11+\\frac12+\\frac13=\\frac{11}6\\;\\Rightarrow\\;C=\\frac6{11}\\ \\mu\\text{F},\\qquad q=CU=\\frac6{11}\\cdot220=120\\ \\mu\\text{C}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 120 μC"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "17": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "R_{\\text{um}}=R+\\frac R2=1{,}5R,\\qquad I=\\frac{120}{1{,}5R},\\qquad U_p=I\\cdot\\frac R2=\\frac{120}{3}=40\\ \\text{V}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 40 V"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "18": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\varepsilon=I_1(R_1+r)=I_2(R_2+r):\\quad 2(10+r)=1{,}5(20+r)\\;\\Rightarrow\\;r=20\\ \\Omega"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 20 Ω"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "19": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "Q=\\frac{U^2}{R}t\\;\\Rightarrow\\;U=\\sqrt{\\frac{QR}{t}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{450\\cdot10}{5}}=30\\ \\text{V}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 30 V"
     }
    ]
   }
