    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\text{haqiqiy: }f=4d_1,\\ \\frac1{d_1}+\\frac1{4d_1}=\\frac1F\\Rightarrow d_1=\\frac54F;\\qquad \\text{mavhum: }f=-4d_2,\\ \\frac1{d_2}-\\frac1{4d_2}=\\frac1F\\Rightarrow d_2=\\frac34F"
